h einem Worte, das die Grenze, das Ende angiebt. अनेकगुण˚ Adj. so v. a. mit einer endlosen Menge von Vorzügen versehen. ˚पर्यन्तम् und ˚पयन्त˚ bis anʼs Ende von, bis auf. पर्यन्तम् allein so v. a. summa summarum."}]},{"n":2,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"2. पर्यन्त Adj. (f. आ)\n— 1〉 mit Etwas zu Ende (Stande) kommend "},{"t":"cite","s":"LALIT. 167,12","q":"LAL"},{"t":"txt","s":".\n— 2〉 nach allen Richtungen gelegen. v. l. पर्यस्त."}]},{"n":3,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"2. पर्यन्त, füge 1〉 vor mit hinzu."}]},{"n":4,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"2. पर्यन्त und पर्यान्तम् (richtig पर्यन्तम्) "},{"t":"cite","s":"IV. 6","q":""},{"t":"txt","s":"."}]}]}],"paryantika":[{"id":"paryantikA","headword":"पर्यन्तिका","headword_slp1":"paryantikA","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"*पर्यन्तिका f. der Verlust aller Vorzüge."}]}]}],"paryantiya":[{"id":"paryantIya","headword":"पर्यन्तीय","headword_slp1":"paryantIya","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"पर्यन्तीय Adj. am Ende befindlich ĀPAST. Ś"},{"t":"cite","s":"R. 11,10,6","q":"R"},{"t":"txt","s":"."}]}]}],"paryanya":[{"id":"paryanya","headword":"पर्यन्य","headword_slp1":"paryanya","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"पर्यन्य m. fehlerhaft für पर्जन्य."}]}]}],"paryaya":[{"id":"paryaya","headword":"पर्यय","headword_slp1":"paryaya","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"पर्यय m. (adj. Comp. f. आ)\n— 1〉 Umlauf, Ablauf (einer best. Zeit), Umlaufszeit (eines Planeten) GAṆ"},{"t":"cite","s":"IT. 2,1","q":""},{"t":"txt","s":".\n— 2〉 Wechsel, Veränderung, Verrückung. [] पक्ष्मणो ऽपि निपातेन येषां स्यात्स्कन्धपर्ययः. so v. a. bei denen Alles sich umdreht, auch wenn nur ein Wimperhaar zur Erde fällt."}]}]},{"id":"paryAya","headword":"पर्याय","headword_slp1":"paryAya","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"पर्याय m.\n— 1〉 Umgang, Umlauf.\n— 2〉 Umdrehung, Windung.\n— 3〉 Ablauf (einer Zeit), Wechsel der Zeiten "},{"t":"cite","s":"Spr. 3996","q":"Spr"},{"t":"txt","s":".\n— 4〉 regelmässige Wiederkehr, Wiederholung. चतुर्थे पर्याये beim vierten Male.\n— 5〉 Aufeinanderfolge, Reihenfolge. पर्यायश्चाप्यगस्त्यस्य समपद्यत die Reihe kam auch an A. पर्यायेण und पर्याय˚ der Reihe nach, abwechselnd.\n— 6〉 eine regelmässig wiederkehrende Reihe, Wendung, Satz (in Formeln, liturgischen Handlungen u. s. w.); im Ritual insbes. die drei Umläufe der nächtlichen Ceremonien mit dem Soma-Bechern im Atirātra; Strophe, Satz (eines Liedes u. s. w.).\n— 7〉 Wechselbegriff, Synonym.\n— 8〉 Berührungspunct.\n— 9〉 Art und Weise. अनेन पर्यायेण auf diese Weise "},{"t":"cite","s":"VAJRACCH. 33,8. 9","q":""},{"t":"txt","s":".\n— 10〉 Wahrscheinlichkeit. []\n— 11〉 eine best. rhetorische Figur "},{"t":"cite","s":"KĀVYAPR. 10,31","q":"KĀ"},{"t":"txt","s":".\n— 12〉 bei den Jaina der regelmässige Verlauf eines Dinges und das Ende dieses Verlaufes "},{"t":"cite","s":"SARVAD. 36,11","q":"SAR"},{"t":"txt","s":".\n— 13〉 *Gelegenheit, ein günstiger Augenblick.\n— 14〉 *Bildung, Schöpfung. "},{"t":"cite","s":"MBH. 6,3745","q":"MBH"},{"t":"txt","s":". Fehlerhaft für अनय, wie MBH. ed. "},{"t":"cite","s":"Bomb. 6,84,50","q":"Bomb"},{"t":"txt","s":" und MBH. ed. "},{"t":"cite","s":"Vardh. 6,81,50","q":""},{"t":"txt","s":"^1. lesen.\n[1] Correction submitted by Dhaval Patel, Jim Funderburk. on 20160103. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/CORRECTIONS/issues/216. note: to match with Bibliography in Preface."}]}]}],"paryayaRa":[{"id":"paryayaRa","headword":"पर्ययण","headword_slp1":"paryayaRa","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"पर्ययण n.\n— 1〉 das Umschreiten, Umwandeln; insbes. die Umwandelung eines besäeten Feldes MĀN. GṚ"},{"t":"cite","s":"HY. 2,10","q":"HY"},{"t":"txt","s":". (Comm. = स्वे क्षेत्रे प्रथमं परिगमनम्) "},{"t":"cite","s":"GOBH. 4,4,30","q":"GOBH"},{"t":"txt","s":". (nach dem Comm. das Einheimsen des Getraides).\n— 2〉 was zum Umwinden dient.\n— 3〉 *Sattel."}]}]}],"paryarsaRa":[{"id":"paryarzaRa","headword":"पर्यर्षण","headword_slp1":"paryarzaRa","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"पर्य꣫र्षण n. das U